# Testing Standards

## Test Types

| Type | Framework | Command |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Unit | Jest + React Native Testing Library | `npm run test` |
| Integration | Jest + MSW | `npm run test:integration` |
| E2E (Web) | Playwright | `npm run test:e2e` |
| E2E (Mobile) | Maestro | Manual |

## File Locations

```
/__tests__/           # Unit tests
  /hooks/             # Hook tests
  /utils/             # Utility tests
  /components/        # Component tests
/__mocks__/           # MSW handlers
  /msw/
    handlers.ts
    server.ts
/e2e/                 # Playwright E2E tests
```

## Unit Test Pattern

```typescript
import { renderHook } from '@testing-library/react-native';
import { useMyHook } from '@/hooks';

describe('useMyHook', () => {
  it('should return expected value', () => {
    const { result } = renderHook(() => useMyHook());
    expect(result.current.value).toBe('expected');
  });
});
```

## MSW Handler Pattern

```typescript
import { http, HttpResponse } from 'msw';

export const handlers = [
  http.get('/api/users', () => {
    return HttpResponse.json([{ id: 1, name: 'Test' }]);
  }),
];
```
